---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Sources
eyebrow: Credits
lede: Every outside source Bible Carrel uses, with the notice its holder asks for and its license.
description: The translations, study data, typefaces, icon artwork, videos and software Bible Carrel credits, with each notice and license.
permalink: /sources/
---
{#- credits.json is kept in step with the app's Credits.swift by a test, so its "use" is the app's
    wording. Where that wording reads only beside the app's own layout, the line here says it in full. #}
{%- set useInFull = {
  "amp": "Bible text, shown as AMP in the app",
  "kjv": "Bible text and its book titles"
} %}
{%- for section in credits | bySection %}
<h2>{{ section.name }}</h2>
<ul class="credits">
  {%- for credit in section.credits %}
  {%- set use = useInFull[credit.id] or credit.use %}
  <li id="credit-{{ credit.id }}">
    <p class="credit-head">
      <span class="credit-name">{{ credit.name }}{% if use != "Bible text" %} · {{ use }}{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="credit-license">
        {%- if credit.licenseFile %}<a href="{{ credit.licenseFile | licenseHref | url }}">{{ credit.license }}</a>
        {%- elif credit.licenseLink %}<a href="{{ credit.licenseLink }}">{{ credit.license }}</a>
        {%- else %}{{ credit.license }}{% endif -%}
      </span>
    </p>
    <p class="credit-notice">{% if credit.noticeLinks.length %}{{ credit.notice | linkNotice(credit.noticeLinks) | safe }}{% else %}{{ credit.notice }}{% endif %}</p>
    <p class="credit-address"><a href="{{ credit.link }}">{{ credit.link | replace("https://", "") }}</a></p>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- endfor %}
